ashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134408832,imgsize-59248.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Turkey school shooting: 11 wounded outside Manisa high school, suspect arrested]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134408529.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/turkey-school-shooting-11-wounded-outside-manisa-high-school-suspect-arrested/articleshow/134408529.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/turkey-school-shooting-11-wounded-outside-manisa-high-school-suspect-arrested/articleshow/134408529.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T15:16:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134408673,imgsize-569197.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1984, Denis Bartell crossed Australia’s Simpson Desert alone in a 390-km trek]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134408303.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1984-denis-bartell-crossed-australias-simpson-desert-alone-the-390-km-trek-took-three-weeks-with-no-backup-vehicles/articleshow/134408303.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1984-denis-bartell-crossed-australias-simpson-desert-alone-the-390-km-trek-took-three-weeks-with-no-backup-vehicles/articleshow/134408303.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T15:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134408337,imgsize-1240958.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A school principal brought Chinese gooseberry seeds in 1904; kiwifruit hits record forecast]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134407648.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 1904, Mary Isabel Fraser introduced Chinese gooseberry seeds to New Zealand, igniting a transformative journey in agriculture. By 1910, these seeds bore fruit, and in 1959, exporters rebranded the fruit as 'kiwifruit' for U.S. markets. Today, New Zealand holds the title of the largest kiwifruit exporter globally, with production on the rise, overcoming past diseases and anticipating record exports for the 2025/2026 season.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-school-principal-brought-chinese-gooseberry-seeds-from-china-in-1904-122-years-later-new-zealand-forecasts-record-kiwifruit-production/articleshow/134407648.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-school-principal-brought-chinese-gooseberry-seeds-from-china-in-1904-122-years-later-new-zealand-forecasts-record-kiwifruit-production/articleshow/134407648.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T17:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134407787,imgsize-109804.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Archaeologists found an pendant in Russia showing a Christian saint and a Medusa-like figure]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134406965.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[An 11th-century pendant was found in Staraya Russa combining Christian and pagan imagery. One side depicts a warrior saint, while the other shows a snake-haired woman. This artifact represents a fusion of Byzantine and local traditions. Such pendants likely served as protective amulets against illness and misfortune. The discovery highlights Staraya Russa's cultural connections and local craft production.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/archaeologists-found-an-11th-century-pendant-in-russia-showing-a-christian-saint-and-a-medusa-like-figure/articleshow/134406965.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/archaeologists-found-an-11th-century-pendant-in-russia-showing-a-christian-saint-and-a-medusa-like-figure/articleshow/134406965.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T14:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134407133,imgsize-323205.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Mass casualty' alert? Pakistan hospitals clear beds ahead of PTI protest]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134408596.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/mass-casualty-alert-pakistan-hospitals-clear-beds-ahead-of-pti-protest/articleshow/134408596.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/mass-casualty-alert-pakistan-hospitals-clear-beds-ahead-of-pti-protest/articleshow/134408596.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T15:10:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134408627,imgsize-105956.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New $555 million Belmont Park opens with smaller grandstand and four new tracks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134406720.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-rebuilt-belmont-park-for-555-million-after-closing-it-for-three-years-the-new-grandstand-is-one-fifth-the-old-size-four-tracks-are-new-and-year-round-racing-is-coming-for-the-first-time/articleshow/134406720.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-rebuilt-belmont-park-for-555-million-after-closing-it-for-three-years-the-new-grandstand-is-one-fifth-the-old-size-four-tracks-are-new-and-year-round-racing-is-coming-for-the-first-time/articleshow/134406720.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T15:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134407371,imgsize-164186.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Judge allows SpaceX land swap for more than 700 wildlife-refuge acres in Texas]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134405932.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A federal judge has refused to block a land swap that would give SpaceX more than 700 acres of Texas wildlife refuge land. The company would surrender 683 acres it owns in exchange. Environmental and tribal groups challenged the deal, citing ecological, cultural and historical concerns, but the judge said they had provided limited evidence of potential harm.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-federal-judge-refused-to-block-a-texas-land-swap-giving-spacex-more-than-700-wildlife-refuge-acres-the-company-would-surrender-683-acres-as-opponents-continue-their-legal-challenge/articleshow/134405932.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-federal-judge-refused-to-block-a-texas-land-swap-giving-spacex-more-than-700-wildlife-refuge-acres-the-company-would-surrender-683-acres-as-opponents-continue-their-legal-challenge/articleshow/134405932.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T15:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134406160,imgsize-58348.cms"/></item></channel></rss>